Scene II: drop 1-ന്റെ 1..720 rank 1 ആണ്.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are a hero. Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: stone values zero ആയതിനാൽ pours 4,6,8.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are a big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Desdemona]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big hero and a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero: You are a big big big hero.
[Exeunt]

